      "source": "## Reference\n\nAbbott, S. (2015) *Understanding Analysis*. 2nd edn. New York, NY: Springer New York. doi:[10.1007/978-1-4939-2712-8](https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4939-2712-8) — ch. 5, *The Derivative*.\n",
      "metadata": {}
    }
